 R←Test_Alias_014(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;folder;alias;config;res;rc;msg
⍝ Call the API functions `RunMake`, `RunTests` and `ProjectConfig` with an alias rather than a folder.
⍝ All three used to fail with a SYNTAX ERROR: they called `GetFolderFromAlias`, then an operator, as a function.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠('Wildcard' 1)('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Tests/Test_Alias/*'
 folder←tempDir,'/Project1'
 config←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig folder
 config.CIDER.(make tests)←'Admin.Make' 'TestCases.RunTests'
 config ##.Cider.WriteProjectConfig folder
 alias←'test-alias-014'
 ##.Cider.AddAlias folder alias

 res←##.Cider.RunMake'[',alias,']'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'#.TEMP.Admin.Make'⍷res
 res←##.Cider.RunTests'[',alias,']'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'#.TEMP.TestCases.RunTests'⍷res
 res←##.Cider.ProjectConfig'[',alias,']'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Admin.Make'⍷∊res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}##.Cider.DropAlias alias
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
